Harriet: Not a good idea, Janet. Did you know that one cola has as much sugar as about eight spoonfuls?
Janet: Really? That much sugar in one drink?
Harriet: Yes. And that sugar attacks your teeth for around twenty minutes each time you drink it.
Janet: Hmm. So what should I order instead?
Harriet: Why not try a fresh fruit juice? It''s sweet but much healthier.
Janet: All right. And maybe a salad too?
Harriet: Good choice. But ask for the dressing on the side — some dressings are full of fat.
Janet: Thanks, Harriet. You''ve saved me from a very unhealthy lunch!', 'Janet 本想点双层汉堡配薯条和大杯可乐;Harriet 提醒一杯可乐含糖约八勺,且每次都会侵蚀牙齿约二十分钟;建议改喝鲜榨果汁,再点一份沙拉,但酱汁分开放,因为有些酱汁脂肪很高。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What does Janet first want to order?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["A burger with chips and a large cola.","A bowl of fruit salad.","A cup of green tea.","A plate of roast beef."]},{"q":"How much sugar does Harriet say a cola has?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["No sugar at all.","About eight spoonfuls.","Just one spoonful.","Two whole cups."]},{"q":"How long does the sugar attack the teeth each time?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Around twenty minutes.","A whole day.","Only one minute.","Several hours."]},{"q":"What drink does Harriet suggest instead?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Another cola.","Fresh fruit juice.","Hot chocolate.","A milkshake."]},{"q":"Why should Janet ask for the dressing on the side?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["The salad is too cold.","The dressing is too sweet.","Some dressings contain a lot of fat.","The waiter is too busy."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required2', 'U1', 'fltrp');
Lucy: If you like spicy food, you should try the Gong Bao chicken. It''s the chef''s best dish.
Tom: Spicy chicken with peanuts? That sounds good. What about you?
Lucy: I''m a vegetarian, so I''ll have the tofu and vegetables.
Tom: Good idea. Shall we share a soup as well?
Lucy: Yes, but let''s avoid the very salty one. How about the tomato and egg soup?
Tom: Perfect. And for dessert?
Lucy: They make a wonderful fruit pudding here. It''s sweet but not too heavy.
Tom: You really know this place well!
Lucy: I should — I come here almost every week!', 'Tom 拿不定主意点什么;Lucy 推荐厨师拿手的宫保鸡丁;她自己吃素,点豆腐配蔬菜;两人合点一份汤,避开很咸的那种,选番茄蛋汤;甜点选清甜不腻的水果布丁;Lucy 说自己几乎每周都来这家店。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What does Lucy recommend to Tom?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["The Gong Bao chicken.","The fruit pudding.","The tomato soup.","A beef steak."]},{"q":"Why does Lucy choose tofu and vegetables?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["She dislikes tofu.","She is a vegetarian.","The chicken is sold out.","She wants the cheapest dish."]},{"q":"Which soup do they decide to order?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["The very salty one.","Chicken soup.","Tomato and egg soup.","No soup at all."]},{"q":"What does Lucy say about the fruit pudding?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["It is far too salty.","It is much too spicy.","It is hard to find.","It is sweet but not too heavy."]},{"q":"How often does Lucy come to this restaurant?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Almost every week.","Once a year.","Only on her birthday.","Never before today."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required2', 'U1', 'fltrp');
Ben: Well, your dad loves roast beef, doesn''t he?
Anna: He does, but Mum says we shouldn''t eat too much roast food.
Ben: True. How about a roast chicken with lots of fresh vegetables instead?
Anna: That''s lighter. Good idea. And for a starter?
Ben: We could make a simple soup. But we mustn''t make it too salty — your mum doesn''t like salty food.
Anna: Right. I''ll keep the salt low. What about dessert?
Ben: Let''s bake an apple pie. Everyone loves your apple pie.
Anna: Then it''s settled. I''d better write a shopping list before we forget anything.', 'Anna 周六请父母吃饭,商量做什么;爸爸爱吃烤牛肉,但妈妈说不该吃太多烤制食物;于是改做烤鸡配大量新鲜蔬菜;前菜做一道简单的汤,但不能太咸,因为妈妈不喜欢咸;甜点烤苹果派;最后 Anna 决定先列购物清单以免遗漏。', 'uk_male', '[{"q":"Why won''t they cook a lot of roast food?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Nobody in the family likes roast food.","The oven is broken.","Anna''s mother advises against eating too much of it.","Roast food is too expensive."]},{"q":"What main dish do they finally choose?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Roast beef.","Fried fish.","A large pizza.","Roast chicken with fresh vegetables."]},{"q":"What must they avoid when making the soup?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Making it too salty.","Making it too sweet.","Making it too cold.","Making it too spicy."]},{"q":"What dessert will Anna make?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["A chocolate cake.","An apple pie.","Fruit pudding.","Ice cream."]},{"q":"What does Anna decide to do before shopping?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Phone her parents again.","Clean the whole kitchen.","Write a shopping list.","Book a restaurant table."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required2', 'U1', 'fltrp');

